- If NetworkInterface.N.InstanceType is set to Secondary or left empty, for instance types that support physical network cards, this parameter can be set based on the instance type. For more information, see [Instance families](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25378.html).', example='0'),
      networkInterfaceId?: string(name='NetworkInterfaceId', description='The ID of an existing Elastic Network Interface (ENI) to attach to the instance.

